  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Volunteer Programme and Civil Society Dialogues (COP17)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Mongolia&#x2019;s hosting of COP17, this initiative focuses on three key areas: youth volunteer mobilization, stakeholder consultations, and gender-responsive storytelling. A core group of young volunteers will be trained in collaboration with UN Volunteers to assist with logistics, interpretation, and delegate support during the event, while gaining exposure to international climate processes. Targeted stakeholder dialogues will be organized with civil society, youth, and Indigenous representatives to inform Mongolia&#x2019;s positioning and ensure inclusive participation. In parallel, a multimedia campaign will highlight local, especially women-led, climate stories through social media and public platforms to raise awareness and engagement around land and climate issues.</narrative>
  </description>
